sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant A as NexaTicket API
  participant V as VietQR
  participant B as Bank account
  participant S as SePay
  participant T as Tickets
  C->>A: POST /orders from ACTIVE hold
  A->>A: seats RESERVED 15m + payment_reference
  A->>V: build QR payload
  V-->>C: QR payment instruction
  C->>B: transfer with reference
  B->>S: transaction notification
  S->>A: POST /api/billing/bank/webhook/sepay
  A->>A: verify, dedupe, match amount/reference/window
  alt within payment window
    A->>T: PAID + issue tickets
  else after expiry
    A->>A: MANUAL_REVIEW no auto-issue
  end
